OL,3,GNEWSATrain announcements too loud, say
OL,4,Aneighbours
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for Greater Anglia,
OL,7,Fwhich manages the station, said it had
OL,8,Fmet with the council and residents and
OL,9,Fwould "continue to monitor the
OL,10,Fannouncements and make any appropriate
OL,11,Fadjustments accordingly".
